<title>UK: CRICKET-LEICESTERSHIRE 148-5 V AUSTRALIA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LEICESTERSHIRE 148-5 V AUSTRALIA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leicestershire were</p>
<p>148 for five at tea on the final day of the three-day match</p>
<p>against Australia on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 220-8 declared and 105-3 declared;</p>
<p>Leicestershire 62-4 declared and 148-5.</p>
<p>Leicestershire require another 116 runs for victory.</p>
</text>
